        ("Doesn't Microsoft back up our Microsoft 365 data?", "Microsoft keeps the service running, but protecting your data against accidental deletion, a departing employee or ransomware is your responsibility. Recycle bins and retention settings have time limits and are not a substitute for a separate backup."),
        ("What do RTO and RPO mean?", "Recovery time objective is how long you can be down before it really hurts. Recovery point objective is how much recent data you could afford to lose. We agree both with you in plain terms and design the backup to meet them."),
